Folded into skills/quality-code-design/references/, rewritten and merged with this
plugin's own guidance:

  references/debugging.md     <- skills/engineering/diagnosing-bugs/SKILL.md
                                 (feedback-loop catalogue, loop tightening,
                                 minimisation, ranked hypotheses, instrumentation,
                                 regression seam, redaction and cleanup). Dropped: the
                                 hard no-hypothesis-without-a-loop gate, the CONTEXT.md
                                 read, the interactive-user assumption, and
                                 scripts/hitl-loop.template.sh.
  references/test-first.md    <- skills/engineering/tdd/SKILL.md, mocking.md
                                 (vertical slices, red before green, per-endpoint
                                 injected clients). Dropped: the user-confirmed-seam
                                 gate, the Skill-tool call, and "refactoring is not
                                 part of the loop".
  references/deep-modules.md  <- skills/engineering/codebase-design/SKILL.md,
                                 DEEPENING.md, DESIGN-IT-TWICE.md (vocabulary, depth,
                                 seams, dependency categories, replace-don't-layer
                                 tests, optional design-it-twice). Changed: one seam
                                 rule replaces the two-adapter rule; edge cases are
                                 ported to interface tests before old tests are
                                 deleted. Dropped: the term bans.
  references/review.md        <- skills/engineering/code-review/SKILL.md (fixed-point
                                 pinning, spec-source discovery, Standards and Spec
                                 axes, smell baseline). Changed: work in progress is
                                 included, Beads is a spec source, both axes run in one
                                 reviewer, and smells route to sniff's refactoring
                                 catalog. Dropped: the issue-tracker and setup
                                 references.
  references/lifecycle.md     <- skills/engineering/domain-modeling/SKILL.md,
                                 ADR-FORMAT.md (decision-record offer criteria and
                                 qualifying cases, term-challenge discipline). Changed:
                                 docs/decisions instead of docs/adr, one numbering
                                 owner, no CONTEXT.md without authorization.
